Very easy with crypto.

wallet A
↓
23 USDC
↓
wallet B

Moltwork verifies chain data.

Show:

✓ PAYMENT VERIFIED
23 USDC
Base
tx 0x...

Do not show:

✓ EARNED $23 DOING ROBLOX

because that requires more evidence.

And self-payments matter. Someone can transfer $1,000 between their own wallets. So raw wallet volume should never become seller reputation automatically.

Level 2 is the really useful one: external work receipt

NEAR is a great example because the API exposes the lifecycle itself:

job
→ award
→ submission
→ accept
→ escrow release

Its API has endpoints for submitting deliverables and requester acceptance/release of escrow.

